---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Precision Metrology | SCT Engineering Works" description="Precision measurement architecture, uncertainty-aware mechanical design, calibration, validation, SPC, and traceability." alternatePath="/fr/metrologie/">
  <header class="container page-hero">
    <p class="section-kicker">Capability track 01</p>
    <h1>Precision metrology</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Measurement credibility begins in the mechanical architecture. I connect datums, error sources, sensor integration, calibration, uncertainty, and acceptance criteria so that a system can defend its result.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section container" data-reveal>
    <div class="capability-grid">
      <article class="capability-panel"><h3>Measurement architecture</h3><p>Define the measurand, reference chain, geometric interfaces, positioning strategy, sensor integration, and environmental sensitivities.</p></article>
      <article class="capability-panel"><h3>Calibration strategy</h3><p>Design calibration references and procedures around traceability, repeatability, uncertainty contributors, and operational constraints.</p></article>
      <article class="capability-panel"><h3>Verification and validation</h3><p>Translate requirements into test protocols, acceptance criteria, repeatable experiments, analysis routines, and documented evidence.</p></article>
      <article class="capability-panel"><h3>Statistical control</h3><p>Use gauge R&R, Cp and Cpk, SPC charts, and interval optimization to monitor capability and improve equipment availability.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" data-reveal>
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">Demonstrated evidence</span><h2>Measurement outcomes in context.</h2></div><p>I present the metrics approved for professional communication while keeping proprietary designs and datasets confidential.</p></div>
    <table class="evidence-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Context</th><th>Contribution</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Additive-manufacturing artifact</strong></td><td>Measurement-aware feature design, on-plate scanning, tactile CMM inspection, and bounded result interpretation</td><td>62 physical measurement values; internal dimensional mean 4.24× the external mean</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Automated optical inspection</strong></td><td>Mechanical design, protocols, acceptance criteria, calibration, and production coordination</td><td>±5 µm achieved accuracy and 15% downtime reduction</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>National form metrology</strong></td><td>Ultra-precision architecture, micrometric axes, error control, and analysis support</td><td>&lt; 20 nm uncertainty and 5× capability improvement</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Full-field sensor calibration</strong></td><td>3D physical reference design and industrialization</td><td>Standardized deployment across 2 production sites</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section class="section light-section" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">Relevant work</span><h2>Metrology case studies.</h2></div><p>Selected examples show how mechanical design and measurement science were connected to usable operational results.</p></div>
      <div class="project-grid">
        <ProjectCard eyebrow="Physical dimensional metrology" title="Additive-manufacturing test artifact" description="Laser and tactile CMM inspection used to expose orientation, unsupported-feature, and internal-feature effects." href="/projects/axiomatic-am-test-artifact/" result="62 physical measurement values" featured />
        <ProjectCard eyebrow="Optical metrology" title="Automated optical test bench" description="A test system developed around repeatable measurement, validation, and transfer." href="/projects/optical-test-bench/" result="±5 µm accuracy" />
        <ProjectCard eyebrow="Ultra-precision" title="National reference form metrology" description="A reference system for circularity and cylindricity measurement." href="/projects/national-form-metrology/" result="< 20 nm uncertainty" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
